@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Login (public demo credentials)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"user1@example.com","password":"Password123!"}

### Own profile and balance
GET {{base}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search (all filters are optional)
GET {{base}}/api/users?dateOfBirth=01.05.1993&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add email
POST {{base}}/api/users/me/emails
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"new@example.com"}

### Transfer; keep the UUID for retries, change it for a new payment
POST {{base}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 28f7b3bf-a4d0-4546-ac15-a8f8c16bb682
Content-Type: application/json

{"toUserId":2,"value":12.34}
